Answer: The report originated from an Axios article citing unnamed sources, which claimed Donald Trump asked senior Homeland Security and national security officials during a hurricane briefing, "Why don't we nuke them?" President Trump denied the report, calling it "ridiculous" and "FAKE NEWS!" and tweeting, "I never said this." The provided search result does not mention other administration officials publicly confirming or denying the report, though the Axios source recalled officials at the briefing telling the president "that they would look into it."

