Answer: Yes, Donald Trump publicly denied the claim on Twitter, calling it a "phony story" and "ridiculous." Specifically, he tweeted, "The Fake News is still trying to perpetuate the phony story that I wanted to use Nuclear weapons to blow up hurricanes before they reach shore."

